WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Alex saves a useful skill. Sam finds it and chooses how to use it.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:24.067
Alex adds the public copywriting skill to Northstar Studio, with a team note, an example prompt, and tags.

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:26.067
The saved recommendation is now available to the whole team.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:38.667
Sam searches the shared library for copywriting, then copies the example prompt and install command.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.400
Save once. Find fast. Use it your way.
